inate grid](images/ef/ef308cba41adc2129841f74c7e265fb107fb99f719b15b6d0971fd33c436a818.png)\n\nFind the coordinates of $-3\\overset{\\to }{a}+\\overset{\\to }{b}$." :question/worked-solution "Both arrows start at the origin. Read their signed horizontal and vertical components:\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{a}=⟨1,-4⟩,\\qquad \\overset{\\to }{b}=⟨4,2⟩.\n$$\n\nScale each required vector, then combine corresponding components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3\\overset{\\to }{a}+\\overset{\\to }{b} &=(-3)\\cdot ⟨1,-4⟩+1\\cdot ⟨4,2⟩ \\\\ &=⟨-3,12⟩+⟨4,2⟩ \\\\ &=⟨-3+4,12+2⟩ \\\\ &=⟨1,14⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186721630 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "108c7537-fc5c-50c8-baf9-a6e33aa8815f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨-3,6⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186721609} {:answer/id #uuid "9633d1b7-1cca-51b7-bc03-2bf0c6fef9b3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨-3,2⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186721623} {:answer/id #uuid "cd2854d8-fd8d-5134-b225-345b6e429e7b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨-3,8⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186721627} {:answer/id #uuid "ea7df32d-a247-5167-ba5b-28ffbfb4c715" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨-4,6⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186721632} {:answer/id #uuid "f12c70b1-71cc-5440-8e61-1d41b74a151a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨-2,4⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186721633}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f12c70b1-71cc-5440-8e61-1d41b74a151a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨-2,4⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186721633} :answer-field/id #uuid "670c8804-1318-5246-9399-59fd40727444" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/